7,Rangpuri | Accent Network,https://accentnetwork.com/rangpuri/,"April 22, 2025. Indo-European.Phonetically, Rangpuri has a variety of unique sounds, including nasal and aspirated consonants. Non-native speakers often find the pronunciation of these sounds challenging. The language has a musical quality, with stress patterns playing a key role.",Rangpuri,Indo-European
